---
title: "Read a quoted SQL literal"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Read literal body
  s1: Check backslash escape
  s2: Check quote delimiter
  s3: Input ended inside literal
  s4: Closing quote found
  s5: Unterminated literal rejected
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: Read quote delimiter
  s0 --> s1: Read backslash escape
  s1 --> s3: Skip escaped quote at end of input
  s2 --> s0: Skip doubled quote
  s2 --> s4: Accept closing delimiter
  s1 --> s2: Skip escaped character and reach next quote
  s3 --> s5: Reject missing closing delimiter
